{"ref":"BDB, יֶ֫רֶק","hw":"יֶ֫רֶק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יֶ֫רֶק</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.6\">Is 15:6</a></sup> <strong>green, greenness (</strong>on <span dir=\"rtl\">ܝܰܪܩܳܐ</span> in gardens, v. Nö<sup>ZMG 1876, 777</sup> Löw<sup>p. 236 f.</sup><strong>)</strong>—abs. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:15\" href=\"/Exodus.10.15\">Ex 10:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.6\">Is 15:6</a>; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:30\" href=\"/Genesis.1.30\">Gn 1:30</a> + 3 times;—<span dir=\"rtl\">יֶרֶק עֵשֶׂב</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:30\" href=\"/Genesis.1.30\">Gn 1:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:3\" href=\"/Genesis.9.3\">9:3</a> (both P); <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶרֶק דֶּשֶׁא</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:2\" href=\"/Psalms.37.2\">ψ 37:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶרֶק הַשָּׂדֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:4\" href=\"/Numbers.22.4\">Nu 22:4</a> (E) = <em>green thing, grass;</em> alone <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:15\" href=\"/Exodus.10.15\">Ex 10:15</a> (J) <em>green thing</em>, incl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵץ</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵשֶׂב</span>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.6\">Is 15:6</a>.","next":"BDB, יָרָק","prev":"BDB, ירק"}